			"notes": "Big update!\n\nNew:\n - New folk with a short-range teleport ability.\n - Each affinity now has 2 active abilities to choose from.\n - Added affinity abilites that spawn temporary blocks.\n - Added talents and defects that alter affinity ability recharge speed.\n - Particle and sound effects have been added to affinity ability impacts.\n\nChanges:\n - Many changes, improvements, balance adjustments.\n - Wings are now automatically equipped.\n - Defects have been strenghtened and split in two layers.\n - Lightning affinity renamed to Air.\n - Folks have been given new names."
